Migrate the Ghidra MCP 7.0.0 bridge to MCP Python SDK 2.2

Use MCPServer and its public middleware, registration, progress, and
subscription interfaces. Keep legacy per-connection notifications alongside
modern subscriptions, with opt-in name-cursor pagination and truthful
capabilities. Expected Ghidra failures remain error-marked tool results.

